@startuml
title CI/CD Sequence - Docker & AKS

actor Developer
participant "GitHub Actions" as GH
participant "Docker Hub" as DH
participant "Azure Kubernetes Service (AKS)" as AKS

Developer -> GH : Push to main branch
GH -> GH : Checkout code
GH -> GH : Login to Docker Hub (secrets)
GH -> GH : Build And Tag With ENV + Deployment No. Docker images\n(weather-client, weather-cache, weather-svc)
GH -> DH : Push images
GH -> AKS : Configure kubeconfig
GH -> AKS : Apply Kubernetes manifests (kubectl apply)
AKS -> DH : Pull images for pods
AKS -> AKS : Deploy Pods Namespace ENV \n(weather-client, weather-cache, weather-svc, redis-db)
AKS -> GH : Deployment status / rollout success
@enduml
